  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Karbon Lestari Bersama - Sustainable Carbon Credit conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity supported the development of high integrity carbon credit markets in Indonesia, focusing on emissions reduction from waste management and mangrove conservation. Through the Karbon Lestari Bersama (KLB) initiative, the programme links international climate standards with Indonesia&#x2019;s national priorities to support a transparent carbon market while contributing to sustainable development and poverty reduction.Between November 2025 and the first quarter of 2026, three workshops and an investor conference in Jakarta brought together government agencies, international partners, project developers and financiers. These events facilitated knowledge exchange, strengthened capacity and aligned stakeholders on policy and investment opportunities, helping to foster partnerships and support Indonesia&#x2019;s climate goals.</narrative>
  </description>
